# Optional. Everything has a safe default; this lab needs no tenant and no credentials (it holds none).
# The shared settings file is ~/Development/.env (mode 600; STANDALONE_ENV overrides the path), read by every standalone app.
# This app reads ONE optional key from it, and nothing else (there is no per-app .env):
# MCP_FLOW_WORKSPACE=default      # the workspace id: 1-32 characters of a-z, 0-9 and -. Scopes the run ids and the trace sink
# Per-run settings (shell variables, not the shared file; the shared file holds no PORT):
# MCP_FLOW_PORT=6650              # control server and UI; must be in 6650-6699
# MCP_FLOW_STUB_BASE=6651         # first of the five mock-actor ports (5 in a row, none of 6665-6669, 6679, 6697)
# MCP_FLOW_BIND=127.0.0.1         # loopback only unless you set this on purpose (the container does)
